  "item_short_desc": "<p>Rothco&rsquo;s Thin Blue Line Silicone Ring is designed for law enforcement professionals who need a safe, durable alternative to traditional metal rings. Crafted from medical-grade silicone, this patriotic ring is tough and resilient, capable of withstanding temperatures up to 150 degrees Celsius and featuring a tensile strength of 80kgf, ensuring it won&rsquo;t break under extreme tension. The non-conductive material makes it safe for various environments.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
